papin (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Project renamed to Papin; packages are now papin-cli and papin-gateway
    (user/group papin; runtime dirs under /etc/papin, /var/lib/papin,
    /run/papin; systemd units papin-gateway.service, papin-agent.socket,
    papin-agent@.service).

 -- Papin Harness Dev <dev@numis.ar>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:00:00 +0000

papin (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

